{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Cairo is the sweetest, most adorable little prince! He is a sleepy, hungry boy and loves to spend time next to his favorite humans. He likes cozying up in bed, watching cat TV, and being the local biscuit maker. He is basically just a chill guy that wants to know what's up :) Big fan of head and booty scratches. Not shy with new people and not too scared of the vacuum but will get nervous if you're not around/are in the shower. He also likes to play with his mouse toys but will get shy if he notices you watching him hehehe. He will be your shadow and love to follow you around. He's excited to meet his fur-ever family soon!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=11&searchType=4&animalid=206833","id":"67d3051616c7d37d8a7deb5810c86fd3","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/694c4cf2a7e641f9ba42083fa61eb19e-1795444150-1795444207-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0175faeefaee47e3b23597feed56abd3-1795444173-1795444173-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/87781b99058641df89e4a4491662dee0-1795444153-1795444153-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/157117672a8c40548470436900e2b8a3-1795444151-1795444151-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b5a13d85c1ae4eab808ee2d5e1f0f9fb-1795444149-1795444149-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e285521ae2f846499d01ea4214989fab-1795444109-1795444109-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/430e2624efb64fc0924c268f6792d7ce-1791081649-1791081671-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/13d9684cd08941379010a40f2